msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion’s corridor was a horrifically repulsive mess. ⟪k:1⟫Splatters of fresh beast "
"blood covered the walls, and there was a repugnant odor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O corredor da mansão era uma repulsiva bagunça. ⟪k:1⟫Respingos de sangue fresco da fera "
"cobriam as paredes, e havia um odor repugnante."

