#: scenario2:scenario2_A177F07C_1047_463B_BCE9_0F87C9060DA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cdb4ce265881daeda6cc16d4039cd78ec8de1bb0ee9a0027f720b36dd1b0226
