msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A177F07C_1047_463B_BCE9_0F87C9060DA4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What did he have to be so afraid of, though? ⟪k:1⟫He had exterminated the other beast "
"encroaching upon his territory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, de que ele tinha tanto medo? ⟪k:1⟫ Ele havia exterminado a outra fera invadindo "
"seu território."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6119AAA3_4E1D_4B90_842C_8C23AB59C05C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f237b5b96b09648a6125eefbcf47fec536d3b874f8d889a6981144a3f2d9dbc
