"⟪k:0⟫I would understand if he had puffed his chest in pride, but far from that, his terror merely "
"intensified."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu entenderia se ele tivesse estufado o peito de orgulho, mas, longe disso, seu terror "
"apenas se intensificou."

