msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Instinctively, he feared anything that entered his territory—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and then attempted to "
"remove it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Instintivamente, ele temia qualquer coisa que entrasse em seu território—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e, "
"portanto, tentou removê-la."

